WEBVTT

00:01:53.414 --> 00:01:57.460
| assume you all remember
Kato Kiyosumi-kun.

00:01:57.484 --> 00:02:01.498
I'm told he was crazy about
playing gangster for three years,

00:02:01.522 --> 00:02:04.901
but that he's changing
his ways starting today

00:02:04.925 --> 00:02:09.940
and will re-devote himself to the
sacred way of karate with you all.

00:02:09.964 --> 00:02:13.610
Now, would anyone like to spar with him?

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:14.999
I will!

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:25.779
"Challenger"

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:27.224
Takagi, huh?

00:02:27.248 --> 00:02:31.394
Yes, it probably is your
obligation as an instructor.

00:02:31.418 --> 00:02:33.930
Kato. Do you remember Takagi?

00:02:33.954 --> 00:02:35.999
I sure do.

00:02:36.023 --> 00:02:38.535
He's the one who would
suddenly get stomachaches

00:02:38.559 --> 00:02:42.154
whenever it was almost his turn to spar.

00:02:52.806 --> 00:02:56.052
To think the man known in the
karate world as the "Warhead"

00:02:56.076 --> 00:02:59.723
would get scared of pistols
and come running home...

00:02:59.747 --> 00:03:02.842
This, from a guy who can't
even shoot a water gun?

00:03:14.828 --> 00:03:16.796
Dumbass...!

00:03:23.871 --> 00:03:27.484
Hanma. How's your
sleep-learning working out?

00:03:27.508 --> 00:03:30.000
Sorry...!

00:03:34.949 --> 00:03:39.062
Did you think you could get me
with your pathetic eye-gouge?!

00:03:39.086 --> 00:03:42.181
You couldn't even crush
an egg with those fingers!

00:03:44.058 --> 00:03:46.049
Kato! Damn you!

00:03:49.697 --> 00:03:54.464
Perfect. Now I can teach you all
some REAL fighting karate!

00:03:55.469 --> 00:04:00.430
Perhaps it would be best
if I leave the rules up to you.

00:04:16.857 --> 00:04:19.769
| was starving since
I didn't have breakfast.

00:04:19.793 --> 00:04:22.160
Guess I bought too many lunches...

00:04:43.117 --> 00:04:45.228
Not enough...!

00:04:45.252 --> 00:04:48.552
You're not enough to satisfy me yet!

00:04:55.829 --> 00:04:57.422
Baki-kun?

00:04:58.799 --> 00:05:01.791
Ugh! He ditched cleaning day again...!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:06.216
When a husband is shoddy,
the wife suffers.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.118
That's enough, Mai!

00:05:08.142 --> 00:05:12.288
But he sleeps in class, eats a ton,

00:05:12.312 --> 00:05:16.526
plus he skips school a lot.
He's too careless.

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:19.896
You need to tighten
your husband's reigns!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:20.730
Mai!

00:05:20.754 --> 00:05:23.299
Just teasing! Later!

00:05:23.323 --> 00:05:25.587
Have fun!

00:05:29.096 --> 00:05:33.693
Where could he have gone?!
I'll drag him back here if I have to...!

00:05:38.672 --> 00:05:43.319
I really can't. I'm having a hard time
making ends meet this month...

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:46.556
We're havin' a hard time, too.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:50.894
Baki. You're our friend.
We're always treatin' ya nice...

00:05:50.918 --> 00:05:55.165
Don't pay today and there'll be
plenty o' interest next week!

00:05:55.189 --> 00:05:56.299
Oh, man...

00:05:56.323 --> 00:05:58.101
Alright! What's going on here!

00:05:58.125 --> 00:06:01.459
--Kozue-chan!
--Who's this chick?

00:06:02.196 --> 00:06:05.975
--She lives with Baki!
--The two of you doin' it?

00:06:05.999 --> 00:06:08.378
Shut up! That's none of your business!

00:06:08.402 --> 00:06:11.514
Stop, Kozue-chan.
You don't wanna get involved.

00:06:11.538 --> 00:06:15.952
And why are you letting these jerks
push you around?! Beat 'em up!

00:06:15.976 --> 00:06:20.038
--Beat us up?!
--Baki?! Us?!

00:06:21.915 --> 00:06:25.061
I'll have you know Baki-kun actually--

00:06:25.085 --> 00:06:26.062
What are you--

00:06:26.086 --> 00:06:29.317
--Huh?!
--Kozue-chan! Let's just go!

00:06:30.591 --> 00:06:32.368
Get back here!

00:06:32.392 --> 00:06:33.917
Hold on to me!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.627
Baki!

00:06:42.302 --> 00:06:46.170
--Alright, Baki! Where'd ya go?!
--You're so dead!

00:06:47.007 --> 00:06:49.738
We're safe now, Kozue-chan.

00:06:54.081 --> 00:06:56.259
Why did you run away?

00:06:56.283 --> 00:06:59.762
With all that training you do,
there's no way you would've lost!

00:06:59.786 --> 00:07:04.667
No, that's not what
| do my training for...

00:07:04.691 --> 00:07:07.070
Then what is it for?!

00:07:07.094 --> 00:07:08.404
Bye!

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:09.953
Baki-kun...!

00:07:11.265 --> 00:07:13.376
Stop! It's our turn to clean!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.512
Ugh...!

00:07:15.536 --> 00:07:18.506
"Tokugawa"

00:07:23.043 --> 00:07:24.636
"Hanma Baki" "Shinogi Kosho™"

00:07:26.213 --> 00:07:27.510
"Orochi Doppo” "Motobe lzo"

00:07:28.615 --> 00:07:29.980
Sir!

00:07:33.854 --> 00:07:36.299
We would like an answer to our question!

00:07:36.323 --> 00:07:39.469
Oh, yes. What were
we talking about, again?

00:07:39.493 --> 00:07:43.039
About Hanma Baki's opponent!

00:07:43.063 --> 00:07:50.346
Why did you have him fight a
user of gaudy Cord-Cut Karate?!

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:56.653
Rumor has it you're considering
Motobe Izo to be his next challenger.

00:07:56.677 --> 00:07:58.388
Please reconsider!

00:07:58.412 --> 00:08:02.659
That outsider belongs to no school-
he may as well be a stray dog!

00:08:02.683 --> 00:08:05.595
Funny, I've not heard these rumors...

00:08:05.619 --> 00:08:10.333
I haven't thought one bit about
who to pit against Baki next!

00:08:10.357 --> 00:08:12.451
Please wait! Stop!

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.104
You here, old man?

00:08:15.128 --> 00:08:16.539
It's you...

00:08:16.563 --> 00:08:19.175
I'm sorry. I tried to stop him.

00:08:19.199 --> 00:08:23.213
--Let me do it, old man.
--What?

00:08:23.237 --> 00:08:26.616
Let me be Baki's next opponent.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:27.917
Who do you think you are?!

00:08:27.941 --> 00:08:32.055
Lower your head! We will not
tolerate rudeness in front of him!

00:08:32.079 --> 00:08:33.223
Now, now...

00:08:33.247 --> 00:08:36.793
This here is Kato-kun,
a fellow pupil of Doppo's.

00:08:36.817 --> 00:08:38.995
What?! Doppo"s?!

00:08:39.019 --> 00:08:40.930
I've heard about you...

00:08:40.954 --> 00:08:44.834
Though I'm not as adorable
as "fellow pupil” sounds...

00:08:44.858 --> 00:08:48.738
Unfortunately, we can't let
you be Hanma Baki's opponent.

00:08:48.762 --> 00:08:50.173
What?!

00:08:50.197 --> 00:08:55.678
The arena is a holy land for those
truly perfecting the art of fighting!

00:08:55.702 --> 00:09:01.184
I hear that for three years you
loafed about the world of gangsters.

00:09:01.208 --> 00:09:05.755
Disgraces like you are unworthy
to enter such an arena.

00:09:05.779 --> 00:09:06.990
What?!

00:09:07.014 --> 00:09:13.696
You claim to be his pupil, but I bet
all you do is rub his old shoulders.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:16.099
You would make an unworthy opponent!

00:09:16.123 --> 00:09:19.035
You sure got big mouths on ya...!

00:09:19.059 --> 00:09:21.804
Please hear us out, sir.

00:09:21.828 --> 00:09:24.674
The long history of the
underground arena was born

00:09:24.698 --> 00:09:29.445
from the friendly rivalry between
various traditional martial arts.

00:09:29.469 --> 00:09:33.783
With the style-less Hanma Baki
now on the king's throne,

00:09:33.807 --> 00:09:39.622
would it not be most proper to select
one of us traditionalists next?

00:09:39.646 --> 00:09:41.057
No objection!

00:09:41.081 --> 00:09:46.896
Likewise, letting Motobe fight would
defile the arena's brilliant history!

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:48.197
Motobe?!

00:09:48.221 --> 00:09:52.302
Hey, now. You sure you
don't have the wrong idea?

00:09:52.326 --> 00:09:57.907
The underground arena ain't the
kind of place you're thinking of.

00:09:57.931 --> 00:10:01.390
"Motobe Jujutsu Dojo"

00:10:21.688 --> 00:10:23.383
--We give up!
--We give up! --We give up!

00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:29.939
You there! It must be dreary
playing hide-and-seek alone!

00:10:29.963 --> 00:10:31.829
Why don't you show yourself?

00:10:36.103 --> 00:10:37.280
Hi...!

00:10:37.304 --> 00:10:40.817
--Who're you?!
--Stop, Hanada.

00:10:40.841 --> 00:10:43.853
If it isn't Hanma-kun.
What brings you here?

00:10:43.877 --> 00:10:46.222
Have you come to topple my school?

00:10:46.246 --> 00:10:48.057
No, that's not it...

00:10:48.081 --> 00:10:49.425
Then what is it?

00:10:49.449 --> 00:10:53.317
Um... Do you think you
could give me a lesson?

00:11:00.594 --> 00:11:02.872
Could you leave for a bit?

00:11:02.896 --> 00:11:05.365
Eh? Okay...

00:11:13.173 --> 00:11:16.319
What are you thinking, Hanma-kun?

00:11:16.343 --> 00:11:20.923
| could very well be your next opponent!

00:11:20.947 --> 00:11:25.328
I know. Isn"t that all the
more reason to practice together?

00:11:25.352 --> 00:11:29.255
Who knows, maybe we'll learn
about each other's skills.

00:11:33.059 --> 00:11:34.771
You're an amusing fellow...

00:11:34.795 --> 00:11:37.230
Yes, I hear that a lot.

00:11:38.365 --> 00:11:39.992
Very well.

00:11:59.886 --> 00:12:02.165
Igari! Why are you here?!

00:12:02.189 --> 00:12:05.101
What do you mean we're mistaken?!

00:12:05.125 --> 00:12:06.369
Igari...

00:12:06.393 --> 00:12:09.260
The pro wrestler, Antonio Igari...?!

00:12:11.631 --> 00:12:14.043
The underground arena
is a Grappler's holy land

00:12:14.067 --> 00:12:17.346
meant for the world's strongest
to struggle over supremacy

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:22.418
with their own strength and
without anyone's interference.

00:12:22.442 --> 00:12:28.224
It ain't a place to treasure musty
old crap like history or tradition.

00:12:28.248 --> 00:12:29.759
Isn't that right, sir?

00:12:29.783 --> 00:12:34.764
That's my Anton! You took the words
straight out of my mouth...!

00:12:34.788 --> 00:12:36.599
| disagree!

00:12:36.623 --> 00:12:38.734
If it's just a competition of strength,

00:12:38.758 --> 00:12:42.438
then that's the same as
having dogs or chickens fight!

00:12:42.462 --> 00:12:45.007
It's none other than
an insult to mankind itself,

00:12:45.031 --> 00:12:47.877
which gave rise to the noble history
that is martial arts!

00:12:47.901 --> 00:12:54.204
Yes! But I do like to see people
fight like dogs and chickens!

00:12:55.041 --> 00:12:57.386
What's the matter? Done already?

00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:01.357
There you have it. Now you can leave.

00:13:01.381 --> 00:13:06.395
| have one question. Don't tell
me the next challenger is--

00:13:06.419 --> 00:13:12.051
Who knows? Maybe it'll be Motobe,
or perhaps Orochi-sensei?

00:13:13.293 --> 00:13:14.818
Let's go.

00:13:50.063 --> 00:13:53.009
You're certainly tough.

00:13:53.033 --> 00:13:58.981
My training did start with my father
smashing me into concrete...!

00:13:59.005 --> 00:14:03.533
The strongest being in the world,
Hanma Yujiro...

00:14:04.377 --> 00:14:05.888
Motobe-san...?

00:14:05.912 --> 00:14:08.491
I'm tired. Let's end it here.

00:14:08.515 --> 00:14:09.292
Um...

00:14:09.316 --> 00:14:12.495
Thank you. This was most informative...

00:14:12.519 --> 00:14:16.922
For the coming day
when I fight your father...

00:14:18.558 --> 00:14:20.458
No way!

00:14:22.062 --> 00:14:25.241
So, Kozue, what's going on
with you and Baki-kun?

00:14:25.265 --> 00:14:28.110
Geez, that again?!

00:14:28.134 --> 00:14:31.195
I already told you, he's just a tenant.

00:14:32.072 --> 00:14:35.751
If playing innocent actually worked,
we wouldn't need gossip shows!

00:14:35.775 --> 00:14:39.388
--Just come out with it!
--Stop shaking me...!

00:14:39.412 --> 00:14:41.657
Yo, Matsumoto!

00:14:41.681 --> 00:14:44.810
Didn't appreciate
you buttin' in earlier...

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:56.372
Damn, I'm late...

00:14:56.396 --> 00:14:57.488
Huh?

00:14:59.199 --> 00:15:03.279
I'm telling you, they just took her!
Go help her!

00:15:03.303 --> 00:15:07.450
We'd like to, but nothing's
actually happened yet...

00:15:07.474 --> 00:15:09.352
Did you try contacting the school?

00:15:09.376 --> 00:15:12.688
| can't depend on the school!

00:15:12.712 --> 00:15:14.056
What's wrong, Mai-chan?!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.777
Oh, Baki-kun! It's Kozue___T

00:15:31.097 --> 00:15:33.509
That was a nice speech.

00:15:33.533 --> 00:15:38.314
"A Grappler's holy land where
the world's strongest fight,” huh?

00:15:38.338 --> 00:15:39.949
I love that sorta thing.

00:15:39.973 --> 00:15:41.484
You have business with me?

00:15:41.508 --> 00:15:46.255
No, not so much business
as something I wanna ask.

00:15:46.279 --> 00:15:49.859
Are you Baki's next challenger?

00:15:49.883 --> 00:15:52.795
I'm not particularly
interested in such things.

00:15:52.819 --> 00:15:55.865
Though I would do it if told to...

00:15:55.889 --> 00:15:58.367
So were you?

00:15:58.391 --> 00:16:00.603
And if I was?

00:16:00.627 --> 00:16:02.238
Then I'd crush you right here!

00:16:02.262 --> 00:16:04.073
Think you can beat me?!

00:16:04.097 --> 00:16:08.210
Yeah! I'll beat you and earn
the right to fight Baki!

00:16:08.234 --> 00:16:10.346
No, you won't!

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:12.304
You...!

00:16:15.141 --> 00:16:18.521
--So it was you, Igari...!
--What?!

00:16:18.545 --> 00:16:22.224
Don't play dumb! We have undeniable info

00:16:22.248 --> 00:16:26.062
that Hanma Baki's next opponent
is a pro wrestler!

00:16:26.086 --> 00:16:28.297
What?! I never heard that!

00:16:28.321 --> 00:16:30.599
Bastard! Still playing dumb?!

00:16:30.623 --> 00:16:34.637
What other pro wrestlers
are there besides you?!

00:16:34.661 --> 00:16:40.293
We'll beat you and nominate
our own challenger for Hanma Baki!

00:16:44.804 --> 00:16:47.149
What're you going to do with me...?!

00:16:47.173 --> 00:16:50.853
Well, we did lose out on
some funds 'cause of you...

00:16:50.877 --> 00:16:55.391
And since you're here...
maybe you can pay with something else...

00:16:55.415 --> 00:16:58.661
In place of your beloved Baki-kun...

00:16:58.685 --> 00:17:03.232
--Who goes first?!
--Talk about impatient...!

00:17:03.256 --> 00:17:04.781
Stop...!

00:17:07.393 --> 00:17:09.487
B- Baki-kun...!

00:17:11.531 --> 00:17:13.909
Gangin' up on us, huh?

00:17:13.933 --> 00:17:17.613
--This your "history and tradition"?!
--Quiet!

00:17:17.637 --> 00:17:20.538
This is to stamp out
evil-doers like you!

00:17:32.051 --> 00:17:34.884
What do you want, Baki?!

00:17:36.823 --> 00:17:39.417
Think you're so bad--

00:17:43.663 --> 00:17:46.175
--Hey, what's wrong?!
--What're you fussin' about?

00:17:46.199 --> 00:17:49.032
--My bone's broken...!
--Huh?

00:17:50.804 --> 00:17:53.649
What the hell're you doing?!

00:17:53.673 --> 00:17:55.971
Get 'im!

00:18:21.501 --> 00:18:23.445
So it's you...!

00:18:23.469 --> 00:18:26.302
He's the next challenger...?

00:18:27.307 --> 00:18:28.741
Get lost.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:32.301
| said get lost!

00:18:42.956 --> 00:18:47.403
You're safe now.
Well, I need to get going.

00:18:47.427 --> 00:18:49.538
Um...

00:18:49.562 --> 00:18:51.223
Thanks...

00:18:53.066 --> 00:18:55.262
Forget what you just saw.

00:18:56.603 --> 00:18:58.093
Baki-kun...!

00:19:07.914 --> 00:19:12.428
Dear me! Even with my own eyes,
I can't believe it!

00:19:12.452 --> 00:19:15.364
To think that you would enter...!

00:19:15.388 --> 00:19:19.222
The crowd is important
wherever one goes...

00:19:20.393 --> 00:19:22.828
Well, I should be off...

00:19:33.473 --> 00:19:37.808
Off to the first and
last brawl of my life.

00:19:46.052 --> 00:19:49.765
-It's Mt. Toba!
--No way!

00:19:49.789 --> 00:19:53.316
--That's Mt. Toba!
--Whoa!

00:20:11.911 --> 00:20:15.291
To think he would really enter...

00:20:15.315 --> 00:20:17.793
You knew too, Director?

00:20:17.817 --> 00:20:22.898
| had been told, but I had
to see it to believe it.

00:20:22.922 --> 00:20:25.234
Baki! Baki!

00:20:25.258 --> 00:20:33.258
Baki! Baki! Baki!

00:20:38.137 --> 00:20:40.916
T- Toba-san...?!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:43.519
Check out Baki! He's all surprised!

00:20:43.543 --> 00:20:45.978
Did he not know, either?!

00:20:47.046 --> 00:20:51.160
His opponent IS the symbol of
the Japanese wrestling world.

00:20:51.184 --> 00:20:54.997
Whether he knew or not,
it would still be a shock.

00:20:55.021 --> 00:20:57.232
Fighters to the center!

00:20:57.256 --> 00:21:00.436
Aside from the use of weapons,
everything goes!

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:04.540
Toba-san...! Are you
really Mt. Toba-san?!

00:21:04.564 --> 00:21:07.109
I've been a fan of yours
since I was a kid!

00:21:07.133 --> 00:21:11.046
That was Mt. Toba the entertainer.

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:12.348
Eh...?

00:21:12.372 --> 00:21:15.317
I am here to fight.

00:21:15.341 --> 00:21:17.920
The crowd might not enjoy it much

00:21:17.944 --> 00:21:22.458
but I will be leaving once I demonstrate
the strength of pro wrestlers.

00:21:22.482 --> 00:21:25.144
| suggest you keep that in mind.

00:21:28.254 --> 00:21:32.201
He's big and bulky.
Nothin' some speed can't beat.

00:21:32.225 --> 00:21:36.405
--Should be a cinch for Baki.
- It won't be quite that easy.

00:21:36.429 --> 00:21:37.328
What?!

00:22:44.931 --> 00:22:50.479
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.503 --> 00:22:56.085
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:56.109 --> 00:23:01.757
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.781 --> 00:23:06.762
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.786 --> 00:23:12.301
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.325 --> 00:23:17.840
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.864 --> 00:23:23.512
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.536 --> 00:23:29.051
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.075 --> 00:23:34.723
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.747 --> 00:23:41.278
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.163 --> 00:23:52.188
"Next Episode”

00:23:56.469 --> 00:24:01.316
The giant shadow shakes the battlefield
with overwhelming strength,

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.051
but this is its true form.

00:24:03.075 --> 00:24:06.255
The giant unleashes his sealed strength

00:24:06.279 --> 00:24:09.725
and long-held feelings on the King.

00:24:09.749 --> 00:24:11.593
How will you fight, bay?!

00:24:11.617 --> 00:24:15.230
The battle for pride and honor has begun.

00:24:15.254 --> 00:24:20.215
"Next Episode: Honorable Defeat”
